# Raw station weighbridge exports. These are per-weigh-in records carrying
# account numbers and licence plates, so they must never reach this public
# repo. The ingest script writes an aggregate with neither, into the split
# layout under src/data/weighbridge/ (index.json + per-station meta.json +
# per-year JSON), and THAT is what gets committed.
/data/
